---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/solutions-page.css';
import '../styles/solutions-cloud-consulting.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Solutions | Lotus Technologies"
  description="Build something new, improve what exists, or connect the systems your business depends on. Explore Lotus Technologies solutions."
>
  <div class="solutions-page">
    <section class="solutions-hero">
      <div class="solutions-hero-inner">
        <div class="solutions-hero-heading">
          <p class="solutions-eyebrow">Solutions</p>
          <h1><span class="solutions-tagline-primary">Your Dream.</span> <span class="solutions-tagline-accent">Our Team.</span></h1>
        </div>

        <div class="solutions-hero-art" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="solutions-hero-details">
          <p class="solutions-hero-copy">
            Whether you are bringing a new idea to life, improving the way your business works,
            or connecting systems that were never designed to work together, we help turn the
            need into working technology.
          </p>
          <div class="solutions-hero-actions">
            <a class="solutions-btn primary" href="/contact">Discuss Your Idea</a>
            <a class="solutions-btn secondary" href="#capabilities">Explore Solutions</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="solutions-capabilities" id="capabilities">
      <div class="solutions-cap-heading">
        <p class="solutions-section-label">Capabilities</p>
        <h2>One partner. Multiple disciplines.</h2>
        <p>
          The right solution may live in one of these areas — or combine several of them into
          one coordinated system.
        </p>
      </div>

      <article class="solution-band custom-software-band">
        <div class="solution-copy">
          <div class="service-heading">
            <h3>Custom Software & Applications</h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            We design and build software around the way your business actually works — from
            customer-facing products to internal applications, portals, tools, and workflows.
          </p>
          <div class="solution-points">
            <span>Web applications</span>
            <span>Business applications</span>
            <span>Custom workflows</span>
            <span>Portals & dashboards</span>
            <span>Front-end & back-end</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="solution-visual custom-software-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/custom-software-applications-premium.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="solution-band reverse mobile-connected-band">
        <div class="solution-copy">
          <div class="service-heading">
            <h3>Mobile & Connected Solutions</h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            We connect mobile experiences to the systems, devices, and workflows behind them —
            whether the user is a customer, an employee in the field, or an operator using
            purpose-built hardware.
          </p>
          <div class="solution-points">
            <span>iOS & Android</span>
            <span>Mobile workflows</span>
            <span>Scanners & terminals</span>
            <span>Connected devices</span>
            <span>Payments & commerce</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="solution-visual mobile-connected-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/Mobile%20Development.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="solution-band systems-integration-band">
        <div class="solution-copy">
          <div class="service-heading">
            <h3>Systems & Data Integration</h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            We make separate platforms behave like parts of the same business. APIs, CRM,
            ERP, payments, eCommerce, SaaS platforms, and data layers can become one coordinated
            flow instead of a collection of disconnected tools.
          </p>
          <div class="solution-points">
            <span>APIs & SDKs</span>
            <span>CRM & ERP</span>
            <span>Payments</span>
            <span>eCommerce</span>
            <span>Data interoperability</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="solution-visual systems-integration-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/Systems%20%26%20Data%20Integration.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="solution-band reverse cloud-consulting-band">
        <div class="solution-copy">
          <div class="cloud-consulting-heading service-heading">
            <h3>Cloud & Technology Consulting</h3>
          </div>
          <p>
            We help determine what the technology should look like before anyone starts buying,
            migrating, or building — then help put the right architecture and infrastructure
            in place.
          </p>
          <div class="solution-points">
            <span>Cloud architecture</span>
            <span>Migration strategy</span>
            <span>Hybrid environments</span>
            <span>Infrastructure planning</span>
            <span>Technical guidance</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="solution-visual cloud-consulting-visual" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="solutions-cta-wrap">
      <div class="solutions-cta">
        <p class="solutions-section-label">Start with the idea</p>
        <h2>Not sure what the solution is yet? That is okay.</h2>
        <p>
          You do not need a complete technical plan before talking to us. Tell us what you want
          to accomplish, what is getting in the way, or what you wish existed. We will help
          determine the right path forward.
        </p>
        <div class="solutions-hero-actions">
          <a class="solutions-btn primary" href="/contact">Discuss Your Challenge</a>
          <a class="solutions-btn secondary" href="/our-process">See How We Work</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .solutions-hero h1 .solutions-tagline-primary {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .solutions-hero h1 .solutions-tagline-accent {
    color: #F2B84B;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .solutions-hero h1 .solutions-tagline-primary,
    .solutions-hero h1 .solutions-tagline-accent {
      display: block;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
  }
</style>
